<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:01.964" end="00:00:03.984" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.500" end="00:00:17.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You.</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.800" end="00:00:32.900" style="s2">I took my sister&#39;s place and married</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.500" end="00:00:35.500" style="s2">into a bloodthirsty werewolf family.</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.900" end="00:00:35.500" style="s2">My husband,</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.700" end="00:00:39.000" style="s2">a broken werewolf who supposedly lost</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.600" end="00:00:40.600" style="s2">his wolf spirit.</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.000" end="00:00:42.900" style="s2">Luckily, I wasn&#39;t greeted by a</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.600" end="00:00:44.700" style="s2">terrifying werewolf husband, but by an</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.900" end="00:00:47.100" style="s2">adorable big dog who wouldn&#39;t leave my</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.700" end="00:00:47.100" style="s2">side.</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.800" end="00:00:53.000" style="s2">I just had no idea who I was really</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.600" end="00:00:53.000" style="s2">cuddling up to every night.</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.500" end="00:00:59.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re mine, Leah.</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.100" end="00:00:59.800" style="s2">Mine alone.</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.200" end="00:01:11.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not marrying him. Tell them to take</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.300" end="00:01:13.300" style="s2">all this back.</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.000" end="00:01:14.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darling, watch your hands.</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.300" end="00:01:16.600" style="s2">Ronan&#39;s lost his wolf spirit and his</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.800" end="00:01:17.900" style="s2">mind.</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.600" end="00:01:21.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want me to spend the rest of my life</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.900" end="00:01:21.500" style="s2">babysitting that useless wreck?</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.000" end="00:01:24.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This marriage was agreed on 10 years</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.700" end="00:01:26.100" style="s2">ago.</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.800" end="00:01:27.400" style="s2">It&#39;s the price of the Northern Pack&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.100" end="00:01:28.800" style="s2">protection.</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.400" end="00:01:31.400" style="s2">Break that agreement and we&#39;re all</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.800" end="00:01:31.400" style="s2">finished.</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.300" end="00:01:35.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.800" end="00:01:42.300" style="s2">I&#39;m not the only Blackwood daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.500" end="00:01:46.000" style="s2">You insisted on marrying Ronan. You said</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.600" end="00:01:47.400" style="s2">he was the finest werewolf in the north.</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.000" end="00:01:49.200" style="s2">Now that he&#39;s hurt, you want me to take</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.400" end="00:01:51.600" style="s2">your place?</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.200" end="00:01:54.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up. You&#39;re a bastard. What makes</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.600" end="00:01:54.900" style="s2">you think you get to bargain with us?</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.900" end="00:01:58.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s right. I have no say in this</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.700" end="00:02:00.492" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.700" end="00:02:03.492" style="s2">Today they can hand me over Ronan.</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.492" end="00:02:04.992" style="s2">Tomorrow it could be someone else.</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.492" end="00:02:06.692" style="s2">Then this time at least I&#39;m taking</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.992" end="00:02:07.892" style="s2">what&#39;s mine.</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.692" end="00:02:09.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.892" end="00:02:12.492" style="s2">I&#39;ll marry him.</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.592" end="00:02:12.492" style="s2">But I have conditions.</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.292" end="00:02:18.192" style="s2">Give me back my mother&#39;s inheritance,</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.492" end="00:02:20.692" style="s2">the deeds, the gold,</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.192" end="00:02:20.692" style="s2">and this.</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.992" end="00:02:25.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.092" end="00:02:25.492" style="s2">I expect you to keep your word.</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.892" end="00:02:33.492" style="s2">When that useless wreck throws you out,</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.692" end="00:02:33.492" style="s2">don&#39;t come crawling back to us.</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.392" end="00:02:41.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.492" end="00:02:41.292" style="s2">I won&#39;t be back.</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.092" end="00:02:46.392" style="s2">Even emptier than I expected. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.192" end="00:02:48.092" style="s2">At least it&#39;s quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.392" end="00:02:49.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Fenwick hasn&#39;t wanted to see anyone</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.092" end="00:02:50.992" style="s2">since his injury. [music] I&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.392" end="00:02:53.592" style="s2">looking after you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.992" end="00:02:53.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s all right.</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.992" end="00:02:57.292" style="s2">It&#39;s not as if I want to see him either.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.492" end="00:03:08.392" style="s2">There.</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.592" end="00:03:11.292" style="s2">Such a brave boy.</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.392" end="00:03:11.292" style="s2">How are you this cute?</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.492" end="00:03:20.392" style="s2">Where&#39;s my room?</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.892" end="00:03:21.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I dreaming? [music] That&#39;s Ronan</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.392" end="00:03:25.092" style="s2">letting her carry him around like an</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.992" end="00:03:25.092" style="s2">actual dog.</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.192" end="00:03:28.892" style="s2">This way, please.</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.792" end="00:03:34.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, time for bed. Coming with me?</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.462" end="00:03:39.482" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.082" end="00:03:42.102" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.592" end="00:03:50.292" style="s2">Stop it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.292" end="00:03:56.892" style="s2">Oh, it was you. I thought</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.792" end="00:04:03.694" style="s2">Never [music] mind.</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.092" end="00:04:03.694" style="s2">Next time a will do.</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.194" end="00:04:13.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m so sorry, ma&#39;am. I&#39;ll clean it up</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.894" end="00:04:14.994" style="s2">right away.</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.694" end="00:04:16.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.994" end="00:04:18.094" style="s2">You&#39;re bleeding.</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.694" end="00:04:20.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.094" end="00:04:21.294" style="s2">I&#39;ve stained the rug, too.</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.094" end="00:04:22.794" style="s2">Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.294" end="00:04:25.494" style="s2">I knocked the glass over. You didn&#39;t do</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.794" end="00:04:25.494" style="s2">anything wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.094" end="00:04:29.194" style="s2">Come on. [music] Sit down.</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.694" end="00:04:38.433" style="s2">Your maid&#39;s back home must have loved</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.294" end="00:04:38.433" style="s2">you. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.594" end="00:04:42.794" style="s2">Back home, I was the maid.</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.594" end="00:04:51.694" style="s2">There.</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.794" end="00:04:51.694" style="s2">Keep it dry today.</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.894" end="00:04:56.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, Mrs. Blackwood is on the</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.094" end="00:04:56.694" style="s2">telephone.</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.594" end="00:05:02.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it?</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.694" end="00:05:03.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did Ronan come to your room last night?</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.294" end="00:05:04.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.294" end="00:05:06.094" style="s2">He hasn&#39;t wanted to see anyone since he</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.694" end="00:05:07.294" style="s2">was hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.094" end="00:05:08.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you haven&#39;t even met your own</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.294" end="00:05:10.094" style="s2">husband?</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.594" end="00:05:11.694" style="s2">How pathetic.</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.094" end="00:05:14.094" style="s2">I thought someone might finally want</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.694" end="00:05:16.894" style="s2">you. Turns out even an idiot can&#39;t stand</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.094" end="00:05:19.494" style="s2">the sight of you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.894" end="00:05:21.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re good at crying, aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.494" end="00:05:25.294" style="s2">Play the helpless little thing, wag your</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.594" end="00:05:25.294" style="s2">tail for that werewolf. Maybe he&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.694" end="00:05:33.594" style="s2">Did that just hang up on me?</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.194" end="00:05:39.694" style="s2">Ma&#39;am,</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.294" end="00:05:46.094" style="s2">breakfast was lovely.</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.994" end="00:05:46.094" style="s2">Please thank the cook for me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.894" end="00:06:00.294" style="s2">When I was little, I scored one point</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.594" end="00:06:01.894" style="s2">higher than Vanessa at school. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.294" end="00:06:04.294" style="s2">Catherine made me kneel in the snow all</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.894" end="00:06:04.294" style="s2">day.</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.794" end="00:06:10.695" style="s2">When my mother died, [music] I knew was</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.995" end="00:06:10.695" style="s2">no one left in the world who loved me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.195" end="00:06:18.895" style="s2">I didn&#39;t expect Ronan to love me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.595" end="00:06:18.895" style="s2">But why won&#39;t he even meet me?</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.495" end="00:06:22.995" style="s2">But he&#39;s hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.395" end="00:06:25.799" style="s2">Maybe he&#39;s having an even harder time</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.995" end="00:06:27.819" style="s2">than I am. I don&#39;t want to push him.</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.799" end="00:06:27.819" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.395" end="00:06:33.695" style="s2">All right. [music] I can&#39;t keep crying</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.095" end="00:06:36.395" style="s2">all over you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.695" end="00:06:39.395" style="s2">Look at you. I&#39;ve got you all wet.</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.395" end="00:06:39.395" style="s2">Let&#39;s go have a bath.</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.895" end="00:06:42.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Together?</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.395" end="00:06:52.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing over there? Come on</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.295" end="00:06:52.695" style="s2">in.</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.495" end="00:06:56.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I&#39;m not ready for this.</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.295" end="00:07:02.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me your paw.</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.795" end="00:07:06.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.795" end="00:07:08.195" style="s2">The bath&#39;s for me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.495" end="00:07:10.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong? You were so excited a</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.195" end="00:07:10.795" style="s2">minute ago.</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.195" end="00:07:14.924" style="s2">Great.</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.295" end="00:07:16.295" style="s2">Now we both need a bath.</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.924" end="00:07:18.795" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.295" end="00:07:20.795" style="s2">What are you looking at?</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.795" end="00:07:23.595" style="s2">Leah, get a grip. He&#39;s a dog. What are</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.795" end="00:07:23.595" style="s2">you blushing for?</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.695" end="00:07:26.895" style="s2">Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.195" end="00:07:37.495" style="s2">What is it?</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.195" end="00:07:40.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father needs 500 gold coins. Have</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.495" end="00:07:40.495" style="s2">Ronan send them over.</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.595" end="00:07:43.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This marriage brought you the North&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.995" end="00:07:44.495" style="s2">protection.</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.295" end="00:07:45.995" style="s2">You already have [music] that.</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.495" end="00:07:47.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a Fenric now and you&#39;ve already</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.995" end="00:07:50.895" style="s2">forgotten who raised you?</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.895" end="00:07:53.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s my husband, not your purse.</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.895" end="00:07:55.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You ungrateful You&#39;d better think</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.495" end="00:07:57.395" style="s2">very carefully.</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.495" end="00:08:00.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s never even met me and she&#39;s still</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.395" end="00:08:00.195" style="s2">looking out for me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.195" end="00:08:06.695" style="s2">For me?</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.495" end="00:08:12.297" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.897" end="00:08:12.297" style="s2">I love it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.097" end="00:08:22.497" style="s2">All this is</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.497" end="00:08:22.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From Mr. Fernyhough, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.897" end="00:08:29.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please thank him for me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.597" end="00:08:29.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Would you like to try this one on?</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.835" end="00:08:36.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.197" end="00:08:37.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.097" end="00:08:39.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It suits you. Could you lower your head</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.497" end="00:08:39.797" style="s2">a little?</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.997" end="00:08:48.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, what&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.626" end="00:08:48.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.497" end="00:08:52.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.397" end="00:08:58.897" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry. I meant no offense.</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.597" end="00:09:00.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, what&#39;s gotten into you? He was only</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.897" end="00:09:01.397" style="s2">helping me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.197" end="00:09:03.397" style="s2">Get up.</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.397" end="00:09:05.297" style="s2">He&#39;s usually such a good dog. He won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.397" end="00:09:06.297" style="s2">hurt you for no reason.</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.297" end="00:09:09.297" style="s2">Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.297" end="00:09:10.861" style="s2">No scaring people.</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.297" end="00:09:13.597" style="s2">See?</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.861" end="00:09:13.597" style="s2">[snorts] Such a good boy.</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.697" end="00:09:19.297" style="s2">I&#39;ll leave it for now. Thank you. You</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.497" end="00:09:19.297" style="s2">can get back to work.</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.297" end="00:09:24.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s getting better at winning me over.</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.297" end="00:09:30.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t this prettier than all that</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.397" end="00:09:30.897" style="s2">jewelry?</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.397" end="00:09:37.097" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll wear this.</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.797" end="00:09:39.597" style="s2">You picked it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.097" end="00:09:39.597" style="s2">I love it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.611" end="00:09:45.631" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.797" end="00:09:49.597" style="s2">I&#39;m supposed to wear this when we have</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.097" end="00:09:51.097" style="s2">guests tomorrow. Look what you&#39;ve done.</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.597" end="00:09:54.897" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry. I scrubbed too hard. I can</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.097" end="00:09:54.897" style="s2">mend it. Don&#39;t touch me, you animal.</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.797" end="00:10:05.697" style="s2">Help.</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.797" end="00:10:07.297" style="s2">Please, somebody help me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.697" end="00:10:09.297" style="s2">Scream all you want.</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.297" end="00:10:11.198" style="s2">Mother will take my side. Father will</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.297" end="00:10:13.742" style="s2">just tell you to shut up. That&#39;s how</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.198" end="00:10:15.052" style="s2">it&#39;s always been, hasn&#39;t it?</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.742" end="00:10:16.898" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.052" end="00:10:18.798" style="s2">[crying and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.898" end="00:10:20.898" style="s2">No one&#39;s coming.</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.798" end="00:10:22.698" style="s2">No one loves me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.898" end="00:10:25.098" style="s2">Maybe I was a joke from the day I was</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.698" end="00:10:25.098" style="s2">born.</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.112" end="00:10:53.198" style="s2">[laughter] Who?</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.198" end="00:10:53.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be afraid. I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.298" end="00:10:58.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t go.</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.798" end="00:10:58.798" style="s2">I&#39;m so cold.</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.898" end="00:11:11.498" style="s2">Did I just have a sex dream? Who was</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.598" end="00:11:14.998" style="s2">that man?</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.498" end="00:11:14.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, your sister is here.</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.998" end="00:11:19.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, got it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.932" end="00:11:19.952" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.552" end="00:11:22.572" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.998" end="00:11:28.798" style="s2">Why didn&#39;t you come down to greet me? I</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.498" end="00:11:28.798" style="s2">had to come all the way up here.</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.298" end="00:11:37.898" style="s2">A sapphire this size.</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.298" end="00:11:39.798" style="s2">Mother begged father for years and he</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.898" end="00:11:41.998" style="s2">never bought her one. Ronan&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.798" end="00:11:43.898" style="s2">generous, hasn&#39;t he? It was a gift from</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.998" end="00:11:45.198" style="s2">Mr. Fenred to his wife.</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.898" end="00:11:46.298" style="s2">His wife?</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.198" end="00:11:48.798" style="s2">You&#39;re calling her the lady of the</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.298" end="00:11:48.798" style="s2">house?</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.098" end="00:11:55.198" style="s2">What do you want, Vanessa?</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.698" end="00:12:02.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s Ronan?</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.298" end="00:12:03.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His wife&#39;s sister is here. Can&#39;t he come</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.398" end="00:12:04.798" style="s2">say hello?</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.298" end="00:12:06.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He needs to rest.</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.798" end="00:12:08.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only one pillow.</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.498" end="00:12:10.498" style="s2">He doesn&#39;t sleep here with you?</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.298" end="00:12:13.699" style="s2">So it&#39;s true. You don&#39;t even know what</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.498" end="00:12:13.699" style="s2">your own husband looks like.</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.099" end="00:12:18.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t get too pleased with yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.399" end="00:12:20.099" style="s2">This means nothing. Any woman who</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.099" end="00:12:21.199" style="s2">married him would get the same.</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.099" end="00:12:23.599" style="s2">If that&#39;s all you came to say, you can</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.199" end="00:12:23.599" style="s2">leave now.</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.199" end="00:12:27.999" style="s2">I&#39;m taking this.</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.599" end="00:12:30.799" style="s2">I gave you this marriage. I deserve</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.999" end="00:12:32.899" style="s2">something in return.</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.799" end="00:12:34.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put it down.</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.899" end="00:12:37.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you giving me orders? Ronan gave</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.899" end="00:12:38.599" style="s2">these to me. You can&#39;t take them. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.299" end="00:12:40.799" style="s2">forget.</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.599" end="00:12:43.599" style="s2">Back home, if I wanted something, you</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.799" end="00:12:43.599" style="s2">handed it over.</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.999" end="00:12:53.599" style="s2">That was your home.</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.899" end="00:12:53.599" style="s2">This is mine.</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.899" end="00:13:02.199" style="s2">See?</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.499" end="00:13:04.999" style="s2">If I can&#39;t have it,</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.199" end="00:13:04.999" style="s2">neither can you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.799" end="00:13:08.799" style="s2">It&#39;s time for you to leave.</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.099" end="00:13:14.199" style="s2">You&#39;ve never even met Ronan, and you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:13:11.799" end="00:13:15.599" style="s2">already so protective of his things.</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.199" end="00:13:16.899" style="s2">Just like your mother.</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.599" end="00:13:18.899" style="s2">Give her a little something and she&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.899" end="00:13:20.799" style="s2">throw herself at anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.899" end="00:13:21.999" style="s2">Leave my mother out of this.</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.799" end="00:13:23.699" style="s2">Why?</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.999" end="00:13:26.599" style="s2">She could crawl into father&#39;s bed, but I</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.699" end="00:13:26.599" style="s2">can&#39;t talk about it.</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.399" end="00:13:32.499" style="s2">You didn&#39;t want this marriage,</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.299" end="00:13:34.599" style="s2">but you want everything that comes with</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.499" end="00:13:37.099" style="s2">it. You don&#39;t get to have it both ways,</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.599" end="00:13:37.099" style="s2">Vanessa.</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.449" end="00:13:42.499" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.499" end="00:13:45.099" style="s2">Let go. Don&#39;t touch me again.</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.499" end="00:13:45.099" style="s2">Get in here.</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.899" end="00:13:48.999" style="s2">Father didn&#39;t send you here to stand</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.299" end="00:13:51.199" style="s2">around and watch. Hold that ungrateful</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.999" end="00:13:53.824" style="s2">bastard down.</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.199" end="00:13:54.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.824" end="00:13:56.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.479" end="00:13:56.499" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.994" end="00:14:05.669" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.649" end="00:14:05.669" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.399" end="00:14:11.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Vanessa, the dog.</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.599" end="00:14:13.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare that animal bare its teeth at</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.599" end="00:14:13.799" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.129" end="00:14:18.201" style="s2">[panting and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.899" end="00:14:18.201" style="s2">Drag it outside and kill it.</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.501" end="00:14:26.101" style="s2">Move.</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.001" end="00:14:32.501" style="s2">No one&#39;s taking him anywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.601" end="00:14:36.401" style="s2">So this animal is what you care about</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.501" end="00:14:38.101" style="s2">most.</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.401" end="00:14:39.201" style="s2">Tell your men to back off.</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.101" end="00:14:41.301" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:14:39.201" end="00:14:43.301" style="s2">Get on your knees, apologize, admit you</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.301" end="00:14:45.701" style="s2">were wrong, or watch it die. Your</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.301" end="00:14:45.701" style="s2">choice.</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.801" end="00:14:50.601" style="s2">I&#39;m not kneeling,</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.201" end="00:14:54.001" style="s2">and you&#39;re not taking anything.</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.601" end="00:14:54.001" style="s2">HELP! SOMEONE&#39;S HURT!</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.801" end="00:15:01.401" style="s2">YOU THINK YOU CAN SHOUT AT ME?</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.101" end="00:15:01.401" style="s2">DO IT.</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.301" end="00:15:07.001" style="s2">DON&#39;T TOUCH HIM!</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.601" end="00:15:16.101" style="s2">It&#39;s okay. Stay with me.</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.601" end="00:15:21.101" style="s2">How touching.</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.001" end="00:15:22.501" style="s2">Your husband won&#39;t even show his face.</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.101" end="00:15:24.001" style="s2">The only one willing to stand up for you</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.501" end="00:15:27.501" style="s2">is a dog.</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.001" end="00:15:27.501" style="s2">What are you waiting for? Kill it.</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.701" end="00:15:47.901" style="s2">You.</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.655" end="00:15:58.701" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.301" end="00:16:01.501" style="s2">You.</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.701" end="00:16:01.501" style="s2">You&#39;re Ronan.</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.901" end="00:16:09.201" style="s2">Stay back.</p>
<p begin="00:16:06.201" end="00:16:09.201" style="s2">Don&#39;t come any closer.</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.101" end="00:16:16.502" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry, Ronan.</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.301" end="00:16:18.002" style="s2">I I didn&#39;t know it was you. [laughter] I</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.502" end="00:16:21.502" style="s2">I take the jewelry. I DON&#39;T WANT</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.002" end="00:16:21.502" style="s2">ANYTHING. PLEASE DON&#39;T KILL ME.</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.502" end="00:16:29.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU&#39;RE RONAN.</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.002" end="00:16:32.391" style="s2">Where are you hurt? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.802" end="00:16:38.702" style="s2">Did they do this?</p>
<p begin="00:16:35.902" end="00:16:40.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t go. They&#39;re gone.</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.702" end="00:16:42.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be afraid. [music] They won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.302" end="00:16:42.902" style="s2">touch you again.</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.902" end="00:16:48.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re Ronan. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.102" end="00:16:48.702" style="s2">You&#39;ve recovered.</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.202" end="00:16:59.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.302" end="00:17:06.702" style="s2">You shifted back.</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.086" end="00:17:09.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.702" end="00:17:11.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He saved me. [music] He knew I was hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:17:09.302" end="00:17:11.902" style="s2">He asked me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.802" end="00:17:17.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, shifting back doesn&#39;t mean his</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.802" end="00:17:17.702" style="s2">mind has recovered.</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.702" end="00:17:20.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But just now he was</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.151" end="00:17:22.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.502" end="00:17:23.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His instinct to protect you is still</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.102" end="00:17:24.902" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="00:17:23.302" end="00:17:27.202" style="s2">But since his injury, there&#39;s so much he</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.902" end="00:17:30.002" style="s2">no longer understands. [music] His mind</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.202" end="00:17:32.402" style="s2">is like a child&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.002" end="00:17:32.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ronan?</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.902" end="00:17:36.702" style="s2">Just like before.</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.102" end="00:17:41.302" style="s2">Wait. [music] You&#39;re a lot taller now.</p>
<p begin="00:17:41.502" end="00:17:46.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leah&#39;s hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.502" end="00:17:46.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m all right now.</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.317" end="00:17:51.402" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.102" end="00:17:54.202" style="s2">The one sleeping beside me,</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.402" end="00:17:54.202" style="s2">bathing with me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.202" end="00:17:58.002" style="s2">That was him?</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.202" end="00:18:02.102" style="s2">Get dressed first.</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.302" end="00:18:07.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leah,</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.502" end="00:18:10.402" style="s2">don&#39;t you like me anymore?</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.802" end="00:18:14.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; God, please stop testing me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.402" end="00:18:17.302" style="s2">No, [music] I&#39;m just a little surprised.</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.602" end="00:18:18.702" style="s2">Give me a little time, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:18:17.302" end="00:18:22.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, everything you need [music] is</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.702" end="00:18:22.303" style="s2">here. I&#39;ll some hot water brought up.</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.703" end="00:18:33.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, no more ticking.</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.103" end="00:18:34.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You used to let me. [music] Why can&#39;t I</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.503" end="00:18:35.003" style="s2">now?</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.203" end="00:18:36.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I mean,</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.003" end="00:18:38.903" style="s2">you&#39;re a man now. We need to do things</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.303" end="00:18:38.903" style="s2">differently.</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.403" end="00:18:44.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, Mr. Victor Fenward is here.</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.603" end="00:18:46.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victor?</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.703" end="00:18:49.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Fenward&#39;s uncle. He heard Ronan had</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.903" end="00:18:50.203" style="s2">shifted back and came straight over.</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.232" end="00:18:51.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.203" end="00:18:55.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ronan,</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.603" end="00:18:55.703" style="s2">look at you, finally back on your feet.</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.203" end="00:19:01.403" style="s2">Do you recognize me? I&#39;m Victor, your</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.403" end="00:19:04.003" style="s2">uncle.</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.403" end="00:19:07.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know him, Leah. I&#39;m scared.</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.003" end="00:19:07.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Leah, Ronan&#39;s [music] wife.</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.703" end="00:19:12.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s still the same, sir. There&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.103" end="00:19:12.203" style="s2">great deal he can&#39;t remember.</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.903" end="00:19:15.403" style="s2">Is that so?</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.103" end="00:19:26.803" style="s2">Yet I hear he took on two guards today.</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.403" end="00:19:28.003" style="s2">His fighting skills seem as sharp as</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.803" end="00:19:29.188" style="s2">ever.</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.003" end="00:19:30.303" style="s2">Leah, would you give us a moment?</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.188" end="00:19:32.303" style="s2">[music] I&#39;d like a private word with my</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.303" end="00:19:33.303" style="s2">nephew.</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.303" end="00:19:34.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ronan,</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.303" end="00:19:36.403" style="s2">why is he reacting [music] like this to</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.603" end="00:19:37.603" style="s2">his own uncle?</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.403" end="00:19:40.803" style="s2">All right,</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.603" end="00:19:43.603" style="s2">I&#39;m staying. Just relax.</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.803" end="00:19:45.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s certainly taken to you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.603" end="00:19:47.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s only just shifted back, Victor, and</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.203" end="00:19:48.003" style="s2">he&#39;s had a fright. He&#39;s exhausted. Let</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.203" end="00:19:50.003" style="s2">him rest.</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.003" end="00:19:51.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. I was so pleased to see him.</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.003" end="00:19:53.103" style="s2">I forgot he&#39;s still unwell. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.703" end="00:19:54.603" style="s2">continue managing the north, the</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.103" end="00:19:56.003" style="s2">garrison, the territories. [music] Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.603" end="00:19:58.503" style="s2">worry about any of it. Just focus on</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.003" end="00:19:58.503" style="s2">getting well.</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.603" end="00:20:03.103" style="s2">You&#39;re still young. I&#39;m afraid there are</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.203" end="00:20:04.303" style="s2">things no one warned you about. Looking</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.103" end="00:20:06.303" style="s2">like a man again doesn&#39;t mean he can</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.303" end="00:20:09.203" style="s2">function as a husband. You do well to</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.303" end="00:20:09.203" style="s2">understand [music] the difference.</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.203" end="00:20:24.605" style="s2">Have my former officers replied?</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.503" end="00:20:25.905" style="s2">The</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.605" end="00:20:27.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; border lord has agreed [music] to meet</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.905" end="00:20:28.705" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.105" end="00:20:31.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Make the arrangements over the</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.705" end="00:20:31.405" style="s2">next few days.</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.805" end="00:20:35.805" style="s2">Don&#39;t let Leah find [music] out.</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.929" end="00:20:44.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.605" end="00:20:44.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I still dreaming?</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.805" end="00:20:50.205" style="s2">Rowan?</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.205" end="00:20:50.205" style="s2">When did you get into [music] bed?</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.905" end="00:20:55.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leah.</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.105" end="00:20:55.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, [music] just wait.</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.705" end="00:21:02.105" style="s2">Rowan, wake up. Let [music] go. I need</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.605" end="00:21:02.105" style="s2">to get up.</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.505" end="00:21:08.905" style="s2">Let&#39;s get dressed first.</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.439" end="00:21:12.405" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.905" end="00:21:12.405" style="s2">Silly. You buttoned it wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.505" end="00:21:18.105" style="s2">Start with this [music] one. Line it up</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.005" end="00:21:18.105" style="s2">with this hole and push it through.</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.105" end="00:21:24.205" style="s2">It&#39;s all right. [music] Take your time.</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.705" end="00:21:25.705" style="s2">One button is enough for today.</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.205" end="00:21:29.305" style="s2">He&#39;s like a little boy. [music] I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.705" end="00:21:29.305" style="s2">have to teach him to look after himself.</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.805" end="00:21:37.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Buttons.</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.005" end="00:21:39.805" style="s2">Is this how [music] you do it?</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.205" end="00:21:43.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch me there.</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.805" end="00:21:43.605" style="s2">Let go, Rowan. I&#39;ll do it myself.</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.905" end="00:21:46.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s this? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.605" end="00:21:51.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does this idiot have any idea [music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.805" end="00:21:51.605" style="s2">what he&#39;s doing to me?</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.005" end="00:21:55.705" style="s2">All right, let&#39;s have breakfast.</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.495" end="00:22:04.305" style="s2">[music] Watch. First, turn the knife</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.805" end="00:22:06.805" style="s2">around. Hold the fork in your other</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.305" end="00:22:08.355" style="s2">hand. That&#39;s it. Got it?</p>
<p begin="00:22:06.805" end="00:22:08.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leah&#39;s so clever.</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.355" end="00:22:09.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.905" end="00:22:11.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re the only one who&#39;d praise [music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.705" end="00:22:13.005" style="s2">me for that. Back home, cutting their</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.105" end="00:22:16.305" style="s2">meat only ever earned me a slap. Never</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.005" end="00:22:16.305" style="s2">mind. Why am I telling you all this?</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.605" end="00:22:25.105" style="s2">You can eat it yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.105" end="00:22:25.105" style="s2">How did you know I don&#39;t like that?</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.105" end="00:22:30.306" style="s2">I&#39;m all right. It&#39;s eating, walking,</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.306" end="00:22:32.206" style="s2">sleeping every day.</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.306" end="00:22:33.906" style="s2">It gets a little boring. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.206" end="00:22:37.106" style="s2">We used to play together. You chased the</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.906" end="00:22:37.106" style="s2">hem of my dress, remember?</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.606" end="00:22:47.106" style="s2">You want to play with me?</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.706" end="00:22:47.106" style="s2">Then how about this?</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.406" end="00:22:48.965" style="s2">She&#39;s not going to make him fetch that,</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.606" end="00:22:49.106" style="s2">is he?</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.965" end="00:22:50.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.106" end="00:22:51.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He hates being treated like a pet when</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.406" end="00:22:53.406" style="s2">he&#39;s in wolf form.</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.106" end="00:22:55.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone warn her.</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.406" end="00:22:57.906" style="s2">Go on. Bring it back.</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.306" end="00:22:57.906" style="s2">We&#39;re dead.</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.106" end="00:23:06.006" style="s2">Good boy.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.615" end="00:23:10.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.906" end="00:23:12.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He fetched it.</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.206" end="00:23:12.906" style="s2">Am I seeing things? Is that really Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.106" end="00:23:14.806" style="s2">Fenris?</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.906" end="00:23:18.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I must [music] be dreaming. Ronan Fenris</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.806" end="00:23:18.506" style="s2">fetching a ball for a woman like a pet.</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.506" end="00:23:24.606" style="s2">Hey, you&#39;re supposed to catch the ball,</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.406" end="00:23:27.106" style="s2">not me. All right, all right, that</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.606" end="00:23:27.106" style="s2">tickles.</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.921" end="00:23:30.941" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.806" end="00:23:34.206" style="s2">Damn it.</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.806" end="00:23:38.406" style="s2">The second he&#39;s a wolf again, I forget</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.206" end="00:23:38.406" style="s2">he&#39;s Ronan. Wait, you can&#39;t do that.</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.906" end="00:23:42.806" style="s2">Stop, Ronan.</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.106" end="00:23:47.706" style="s2">Put this on first. It&#39;s time for lunch.</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.206" end="00:23:59.006" style="s2">Back home, I only got leftovers. Now I</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.906" end="00:24:01.506" style="s2">can eat as much as I want. This is</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.006" end="00:24:01.506" style="s2">heaven.</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.606" end="00:24:06.311" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, look out.</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.291" end="00:24:06.311" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.606" end="00:24:12.906" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry. It It slipped.</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.606" end="00:24:18.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ronan?</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.606" end="00:24:19.606" style="s2">That look.</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.206" end="00:24:22.106" style="s2">I&#39;d never seen that look on his face</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.606" end="00:24:22.106" style="s2">before.</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.406" end="00:24:25.306" style="s2">Give me the blade, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.306" end="00:24:30.707" style="s2">It&#39;s It&#39;s right now.</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.836" end="00:24:34.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.707" end="00:24:35.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ronan, scared. Leah, protect me.</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.307" end="00:24:37.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He can&#39;t even hold a table knife</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.507" end="00:24:39.807" style="s2">properly. How did he react so fast?</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.707" end="00:24:41.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s trained to fight since childhood.</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.807" end="00:24:42.207" style="s2">His mind may have forgotten, but his</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.107" end="00:24:44.607" style="s2">body remembers.</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.207" end="00:24:46.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So it was instinct?</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.607" end="00:24:48.107" style="s2">I hope you&#39;re not lying to me, Ronan,</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.607" end="00:24:51.107" style="s2">because if you are,</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.107" end="00:24:51.107" style="s2">I&#39;ll never forgive you.</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.107" end="00:25:04.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir,</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.107" end="00:25:05.307" style="s2">thank goodness you&#39;ve recovered.</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.007" end="00:25:08.007" style="s2">I can rally your former soldiers</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.307" end="00:25:08.007" style="s2">immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.707" end="00:25:11.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t rally anyone yet.</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.607" end="00:25:18.908" style="s2">Find out who in the capital&#39;s garrison</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.107" end="00:25:18.908" style="s2">still recognizes my right to inherit.</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.007" end="00:25:24.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if someone offers to bring troops</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.507" end="00:25:26.807" style="s2">to meet you?</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.807" end="00:25:28.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell them to stay put.</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.807" end="00:25:31.007" style="s2">Any movement now and Victor will know</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.408" end="00:25:32.207" style="s2">immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.007" end="00:25:35.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.207" end="00:25:38.307" style="s2">I&#39;ll report back once it&#39;s confirmed.</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.007" end="00:25:38.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ronan, are you in there?</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.807" end="00:25:44.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hide now.</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.807" end="00:25:47.507" style="s2">Who&#39;s outside? One of Victor&#39;s people?</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.908" end="00:25:50.607" style="s2">My wife.</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.507" end="00:25:50.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since when do you have a wife?</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.908" end="00:25:57.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, we&#39;re on the third floor.</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.908" end="00:26:03.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ronan?</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.007" end="00:26:03.607" style="s2">I&#39;ll come in.</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.908" end="00:26:09.107" style="s2">Ronan?</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.207" end="00:26:09.107" style="s2">I heard voices. Are you still awake?</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.007" end="00:26:17.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir,</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.807" end="00:26:18.807" style="s2">we&#39;re planning to win over the entire</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.207" end="00:26:21.908" style="s2">North Gate garrison. Surely you can</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.807" end="00:26:21.908" style="s2">explain this to your wife.</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.707" end="00:26:29.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing in here?</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.307" end="00:26:30.409" style="s2">I woke up and couldn&#39;t find you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.207" end="00:26:33.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Couldn&#39;t sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.409" end="00:26:33.109" style="s2">Wanted to read.</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.909" end="00:26:40.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your book&#39;s upside down. What are you</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.309" end="00:26:40.709" style="s2">reading?</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.509" end="00:26:46.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, we&#39;ve added logs to your</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.309" end="00:26:48.809" style="s2">fireplace. It&#39;s cold in here. You should</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.309" end="00:26:48.809" style="s2">head back.</p>
<p begin="00:26:50.509" end="00:26:56.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You need to go to bed too.</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.509" end="00:26:58.909" style="s2">I&#39;ll be waiting in our room. Got it?</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.309" end="00:26:58.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ronan&#39;s got it.</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.409" end="00:27:10.109" style="s2">Did I hear that right?</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.109" end="00:27:11.309" style="s2">Was Mr. Fenner just acting all sweet for</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.109" end="00:27:15.509" style="s2">a woman?</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.309" end="00:27:15.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, this is from Mr. Victor Fenwick.</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.909" end="00:27:21.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Ronan Fenwick and his wife are</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.709" end="00:27:23.709" style="s2">invited to a banquet of the Northern</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.409" end="00:27:25.309" style="s2">Lords tomorrow evening.</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.709" end="00:27:27.309" style="s2">Now that you&#39;ve regained human form,</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.309" end="00:27:30.109" style="s2">it&#39;s time you met with the Lords again.</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.309" end="00:27:30.109" style="s2">Victor Fenwick.</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.509" end="00:27:34.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;ll be a crowd and people will ask</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.709" end="00:27:36.609" style="s2">questions.</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.409" end="00:27:40.109" style="s2">He&#39;s only just shifted back.</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.609" end="00:27:41.509" style="s2">I&#39;m afraid it may be too much for him.</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.109" end="00:27:43.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But he can&#39;t spend the rest of his life</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.509" end="00:27:45.709" style="s2">shut away in this manner.</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.609" end="00:27:47.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Some people may not be kind.</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.709" end="00:27:49.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll answer for him.</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.909" end="00:27:50.809" style="s2">He doesn&#39;t have to speak if he doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.209" end="00:27:52.609" style="s2">want to.</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.809" end="00:27:55.409" style="s2">We&#39;ve been invited to dinner. There&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.609" end="00:27:55.409" style="s2">be lots of people.</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.809" end="00:27:59.409" style="s2">I&#39;ll stay with you.</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.409" end="00:28:02.709" style="s2">If you&#39;re uncomfortable, tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.409" end="00:28:02.709" style="s2">We can come home whenever you like.</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.309" end="00:28:08.709" style="s2">Good boy.</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.709" end="00:28:08.709" style="s2">All right, let&#39;s give it a try.</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.009" end="00:28:14.709" style="s2">Do I look nice?</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.409" end="00:28:25.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.109" end="00:28:27.909" style="s2">Even more beautiful than I imagined.</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.109" end="00:28:27.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You imagined it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.209" end="00:28:32.009" style="s2">Another pretty line you&#39;ve picked up</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.409" end="00:28:32.009" style="s2">from someone.</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.909" end="00:28:37.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait me.</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.510" end="00:28:44.010" style="s2">Ronan.</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.110" end="00:28:49.310" style="s2">What wonderful news.</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.910" end="00:28:51.810" style="s2">I was so worried when I heard about your</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.310" end="00:28:55.810" style="s2">condition.</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.810" end="00:28:55.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry. He&#39;s a little shy.</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.110" end="00:29:02.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He can shift back, but this</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.810" end="00:29:02.010" style="s2">still not quite right, is it?</p>
<p begin="00:29:07.310" end="00:29:11.910" style="s2">I thought you&#39;d recovered.</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.210" end="00:29:13.410" style="s2">Turns out you&#39;re still an idiot.</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.910" end="00:29:14.810" style="s2">Leah, how does it feel to have an idiot</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.410" end="00:29:17.310" style="s2">for a husband?</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.810" end="00:29:19.110" style="s2">He can&#39;t even get you into bed, can he?</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.310" end="00:29:20.610" style="s2">If you&#39;re that lonely, find a stray dog</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.110" end="00:29:22.110" style="s2">to satisfy you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.610" end="00:29:23.210" style="s2">Don&#39;t stand here attacking my husband</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.110" end="00:29:26.110" style="s2">over his sex life.</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.210" end="00:29:26.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.710" end="00:29:30.510" style="s2">My cousin found himself quite a wife.</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.010" end="00:29:39.110" style="s2">Gareth Fenwick,</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.610" end="00:29:41.310" style="s2">Ronan&#39;s cousin.</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.110" end="00:29:41.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leah.</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.010" end="00:29:43.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been looking forward to meeting</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.110" end="00:29:45.510" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.910" end="00:29:46.410" style="s2">Father said my cousin was very attached</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.510" end="00:29:48.310" style="s2">to you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.410" end="00:29:50.790" style="s2">Now that I see you,</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.310" end="00:29:51.110" style="s2">he&#39;s a very lucky man.</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.790" end="00:29:53.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.110" end="00:29:54.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go, please.</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.010" end="00:29:56.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cousin, you don&#39;t mind if I borrow your</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.410" end="00:29:58.610" style="s2">wife for a dance?</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.810" end="00:30:00.110" style="s2">You&#39;re so beautiful, Leah.</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.610" end="00:30:02.210" style="s2">It&#39;s a shame to waste yourself on that</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.110" end="00:30:03.510" style="s2"></p>
<p begin="00:30:02.210" end="00:30:05.910" style="s2">Ever thought about finding another</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.510" end="00:30:05.910" style="s2">husband?</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.010" end="00:30:12.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m afraid the answer&#39;s no.</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.210" end="00:30:19.310" style="s2">My first dance tonight belongs to my</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.810" end="00:30:21.310" style="s2">husband.</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.310" end="00:30:22.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ronan, the idiot probably can&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.310" end="00:30:23.610" style="s2">hold his bladder. You expect him to</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.710" end="00:30:26.110" style="s2">dance?</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.610" end="00:30:26.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.710" end="00:30:35.212" style="s2">Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.910" end="00:30:37.912" style="s2">One step forward.</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.212" end="00:30:37.912" style="s2">Now turn with me.</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.612" end="00:30:43.512" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to keep looking down.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.712" end="00:30:46.412" style="s2">It&#39;s all right if you step on my feet.</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.512" end="00:30:46.412" style="s2">Just go slowly.</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.712" end="00:31:02.712" style="s2">What&#39;s going on with him?</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.712" end="00:31:05.512" style="s2">Does he actually know how to dance or</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.712" end="00:31:05.512" style="s2">was that just luck?</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.512" end="00:31:15.512" style="s2">He danced beautifully.</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.412" end="00:31:28.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, few words, please.</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.012" end="00:31:34.712" style="s2">I&#39;m delighted to see Ronan among us</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.712" end="00:31:37.712" style="s2">again tonight. [music] We all hope he&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.712" end="00:31:37.712" style="s2">continue to recover.</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.612" end="00:31:43.512" style="s2">But recovery [music] requires peace and</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.312" end="00:31:46.712" style="s2">quiet. The border territory should no</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.512" end="00:31:46.712" style="s2">longer be his concern.</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.112" end="00:31:49.912" style="s2">So [music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.412" end="00:31:51.412" style="s2">from this moment on,</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.912" end="00:31:52.912" style="s2">Gareth will take charge of Ronan&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.412" end="00:31:54.412" style="s2">border territories. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.912" end="00:31:57.012" style="s2">He&#39;ll shoulder these responsibilities</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.412" end="00:31:57.012" style="s2">for his cousin.</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.912" end="00:32:02.812" style="s2">A toast to Gareth</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.612" end="00:32:02.812" style="s2">and to Ronan&#39;s swift recovery.</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.612" end="00:32:17.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does he understand what Victor&#39;s saying?</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.012" end="00:32:21.712" style="s2">Ronan, let go.</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.612" end="00:32:27.212" style="s2">Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.112" end="00:32:27.212" style="s2">Give me the glass, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.312" end="00:32:30.812" style="s2">You&#39;re bleeding.</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.612" end="00:32:42.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cousin,</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.912" end="00:32:45.813" style="s2">why aren&#39;t you drinking?</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.613" end="00:32:45.813" style="s2">Don&#39;t you want to congratulate me?</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.413" end="00:32:50.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.213" end="00:32:52.513" style="s2">He&#39;s unwell. He can&#39;t answer your</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.013" end="00:32:52.513" style="s2">questions.</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.113" end="00:32:59.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Surely one slip won&#39;t exhaust him?</p>
<p begin="00:33:01.813" end="00:33:06.613" style="s2">It&#39;s just a formality.</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.813" end="00:33:10.013" style="s2">Ronan signs, adds his seal,</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.613" end="00:33:10.013" style="s2">and then he can go home and rest.</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.813" end="00:33:15.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Authorization for the administration of</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.413" end="00:33:18.413" style="s2">the border territories, granting party</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.613" end="00:33:18.413" style="s2">Ronan Fenwick.</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.713" end="00:33:22.713" style="s2">You want him to sign this?</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.213" end="00:33:26.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re family.</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.713" end="00:33:29.313" style="s2">There&#39;s no need to worry.</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.413" end="00:33:29.313" style="s2">Gareth is helping him.</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.613" end="00:33:34.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s still recovering.</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.813" end="00:33:35.213" style="s2">He&#39;s had to learn how to use cutlery</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.113" end="00:33:36.613" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.213" end="00:33:38.913" style="s2">Do you really think he can understand</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.613" end="00:33:40.413" style="s2">what&#39;s written here?</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.913" end="00:33:43.013" style="s2">I won&#39;t let him sign something he can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.413" end="00:33:43.013" style="s2">understand.</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.813" end="00:33:52.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You take very good care of him. That&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.613" end="00:33:54.513" style="s2">good thing.</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.813" end="00:33:55.813" style="s2">There&#39;s no rush.</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.513" end="00:33:57.413" style="s2">We&#39;ll confirm the decision at the</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.813" end="00:33:59.213" style="s2">succession assembly.</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.413" end="00:34:02.013" style="s2">For tonight,</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.213" end="00:34:02.013" style="s2">let Ronan rest.</p>
<p begin="00:34:13.513" end="00:34:16.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That man just now, do you know him?</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.013" end="00:34:20.113" style="s2">Ronan,</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.113" end="00:34:21.713" style="s2">you know what they&#39;re trying to take</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.113" end="00:34:22.413" style="s2">from you, don&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.713" end="00:34:23.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leah, I</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.413" end="00:34:24.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shifting back to protect me from</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.813" end="00:34:28.913" style="s2">Vanessa,</p>
<p begin="00:34:24.913" end="00:34:32.213" style="s2">catching that scythe, and in the study.</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.913" end="00:34:32.213" style="s2">Ronan, do you think I am an idiot?</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.413" end="00:34:40.713" style="s2">I hate being lied to, [music] Ronan.</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.369" end="00:34:57.389" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.614" end="00:35:04.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wasn&#39;t that the lord who exchanged a</p>
<p begin="00:35:01.014" end="00:35:04.414" style="s2">look with Ronan at the banquet?</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.514" end="00:35:10.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victor handed your territories to Gareth</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.414" end="00:35:13.714" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.814" end="00:35:15.714" style="s2">How much longer do you plan to wait?</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.714" end="00:35:16.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tonight was only an announcement.</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.714" end="00:35:20.214" style="s2">He intends to strip me of my right to</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.914" end="00:35:20.214" style="s2">inherit at the succession assembly.</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.214" end="00:35:27.314" style="s2">We need the North Gate garrison first.</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.514" end="00:35:28.514" style="s2">My men will follow you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.314" end="00:35:30.114" style="s2">But they can&#39;t march in just to be</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.514" end="00:35:31.714" style="s2">trapped there. That&#39;s why we move no</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.114" end="00:35:34.914" style="s2">troops and declare no allegiances until</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.714" end="00:35:34.914" style="s2">the North Gate commander commits.</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.714" end="00:35:40.114" style="s2">What about your wife? Does she know?</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.214" end="00:35:45.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She doesn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.514" end="00:35:47.314" style="s2">I can&#39;t risk my uncle noticing anything</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.014" end="00:35:47.314" style="s2">through her.</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.514" end="00:35:55.914" style="s2">Troop strength at the capital&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.514" end="00:35:57.514" style="s2">garrison.</p>
<p begin="00:35:55.914" end="00:36:00.914" style="s2">My guards and I remain loyal to the</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.514" end="00:36:00.914" style="s2">rightful heir Ronan Fenwick.</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.314" end="00:36:04.514" style="s2">Is this muscle memory too?</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.914" end="00:36:17.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leah, I can explain.</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.414" end="00:36:17.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can explain. Of course you can.</p>
<p begin="00:36:19.514" end="00:36:23.714" style="s2">I taught you to hold a fork.</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.914" end="00:36:25.614" style="s2">I buttoned your shirts one button at a</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.714" end="00:36:29.514" style="s2">time. [music] How did it feel watching</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.614" end="00:36:29.514" style="s2">me fuss over you? Stay right there.</p>
<p begin="00:36:29.914" end="00:36:34.275" style="s2">How long have you had your mind back?</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.814" end="00:36:36.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I recovered before you married me.</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.275" end="00:36:36.295" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:40.614" end="00:36:45.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you knew exactly what you were doing</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.414" end="00:36:47.916" style="s2">from the very first day?</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.516" end="00:36:47.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.030" end="00:36:51.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.616" end="00:36:51.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.316" end="00:36:58.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victor controls the capital&#39;s garrison.</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.016" end="00:37:01.316" style="s2">If he knew I&#39;d recovered, he wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.216" end="00:37:01.316" style="s2">let me stay here in peace.</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.716" end="00:37:06.216" style="s2">This was the only way I could contact my</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.316" end="00:37:07.316" style="s2">former officers and win over the lords.</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.216" end="00:37:10.316" style="s2">They still don&#39;t have the strength to</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.316" end="00:37:10.316" style="s2">support me openly.</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.516" end="00:37:17.116" style="s2">If word gets out,</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.816" end="00:37:18.616" style="s2">I won&#39;t be the only one he comes for.</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.116" end="00:37:20.816" style="s2">He&#39;ll hunt down everyone who stands with</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.616" end="00:37:20.816" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.716" end="00:37:26.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t tell anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.316" end="00:37:29.216" style="s2">They shouldn&#39;t have to pay for this with</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.516" end="00:37:29.216" style="s2">their lives.</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.916" end="00:37:33.116" style="s2">But what about my marriage?</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.016" end="00:37:39.216" style="s2">The North wanted Vanessa.</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.516" end="00:37:42.116" style="s2">My father sent another daughter, and you</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.216" end="00:37:42.116" style="s2">all accepted her.</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.816" end="00:37:47.116" style="s2">Why?</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.516" end="00:37:49.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was Victor&#39;s idea.</p>
<p begin="00:37:47.116" end="00:37:51.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.316" end="00:37:52.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He knew you had no power and no support</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.216" end="00:37:54.316" style="s2">from your family.</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.816" end="00:37:56.716" style="s2">Marrying you wouldn&#39;t help me take back</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.316" end="00:37:56.716" style="s2">the North.</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.716" end="00:38:02.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that&#39;s it?</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.616" end="00:38:02.016" style="s2">And you?</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.916" end="00:38:07.316" style="s2">You knew why he chose me?</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.516" end="00:38:10.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:38:07.316" end="00:38:10.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And why I was sent here?</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.416" end="00:38:15.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.716" end="00:38:15.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you agreed [music] to it?</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.716" end="00:38:24.616" style="s2">I thought Marian [music] you meant I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.916" end="00:38:27.016" style="s2">finally stop being someone&#39;s bargaining</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.616" end="00:38:27.016" style="s2">chip.</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.716" end="00:38:32.216" style="s2">My father traded me for protection. You</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.716" end="00:38:34.616" style="s2">used [music] me to keep your uncle from</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.216" end="00:38:34.616" style="s2">worrying.</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.716" end="00:38:39.516" style="s2">And I was the only one actually trying</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.316" end="00:38:41.216" style="s2">to be a wife.</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.516" end="00:38:41.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not how it was.</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.216" end="00:38:43.966" style="s2">Leah, I</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.716" end="00:38:45.986" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.966" end="00:38:45.986" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.916" end="00:38:52.317" style="s2">Don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.117" end="00:38:52.317" style="s2">I don&#39;t know what to believe anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.517" end="00:39:04.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re leaving?</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.917" end="00:39:09.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re sleeping in separate rooms from</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.117" end="00:39:11.517" style="s2">now on. I&#39;m not sharing a bed with a</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.117" end="00:39:11.517" style="s2">liar.</p>
<p begin="00:39:16.717" end="00:39:22.417" style="s2">I promised I wouldn&#39;t tell anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.017" end="00:39:22.417" style="s2">When others are around, I&#39;ll play along.</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.217" end="00:39:27.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And when we&#39;re alone?</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.817" end="00:39:29.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to pretend you need me</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.117" end="00:39:29.517" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.517" end="00:39:43.817" style="s2">Mr. Fenwick [music] sent these.</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.417" end="00:39:46.317" style="s2">He said you could keep whichever ones</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.817" end="00:39:46.317" style="s2">you like.</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.317" end="00:39:50.817" style="s2">No, thank [music] you. Take them back.</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.217" end="00:39:55.417" style="s2">You haven&#39;t even looked.</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.517" end="00:39:58.317" style="s2">I have enough jewelry.</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.417" end="00:39:58.317" style="s2">Thank you for bringing them.</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.317" end="00:40:11.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t come down [music] for dinner</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.617" end="00:40:11.117" style="s2">at it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.417" end="00:40:20.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother, please.</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.717" end="00:40:23.317" style="s2">Tell me what I&#39;m [music] supposed to do</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.917" end="00:40:23.317" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.517" end="00:40:42.317" style="s2">Did you turn into him because you knew I</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.217" end="00:40:42.317" style="s2">couldn&#39;t bear to lose him?</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.117" end="00:40:47.117" style="s2">The moment you used that form to make me</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.217" end="00:40:49.918" style="s2">forgive you, you destroyed the last</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.117" end="00:40:49.918" style="s2">thing we had left.</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.118" end="00:40:58.418" style="s2">Rowan, you&#39;re the lowest man I&#39;ve ever</p>
<p begin="00:40:56.118" end="00:40:58.418" style="s2">met.</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.618" end="00:41:11.418" style="s2">The house deed,</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.918" end="00:41:15.118" style="s2">the orchard deed, [music] the rent</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.418" end="00:41:16.118" style="s2">ledgers, they didn&#39;t give me any of it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.118" end="00:41:18.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are these [music] what you brought when</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.118" end="00:41:18.518" style="s2">you married?</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.618" end="00:41:21.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They only gave me this money and the</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.818" end="00:41:23.118" style="s2">jewelry.</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.618" end="00:41:26.118" style="s2">They still have mother&#39;s house and her</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.118" end="00:41:26.118" style="s2">five acre orchard.</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.318" end="00:41:34.018" style="s2">Please contact [music] the man who</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.518" end="00:41:37.118" style="s2">managed my mother&#39;s estate. I want to</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.018" end="00:41:37.118" style="s2">know where the rest of it is.</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.218" end="00:41:40.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:41:38.918" end="00:41:43.618" style="s2">Your mother left you the two-story stone</p>
<p begin="00:41:40.818" end="00:41:48.018" style="s2">house west of town, five acres of apple</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.618" end="00:41:48.018" style="s2">orchards, and 100 gold coins.</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.718" end="00:41:54.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I only received 30 gold coins.</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.818" end="00:41:56.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The will doesn&#39;t authorize Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.318" end="00:41:57.118" style="s2">Blackwood to withhold the remaining</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.018" end="00:41:58.718" style="s2">assets.</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.118" end="00:42:00.718" style="s2">She&#39;s also been collecting the rent on</p>
<p begin="00:41:58.718" end="00:42:02.518" style="s2">the house and orchard all these years.</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.718" end="00:42:04.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who authorized her to do that?</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.518" end="00:42:07.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father. Mrs. Blackwood said it</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.618" end="00:42:08.918" style="s2">covered the cost of raising you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.318" end="00:42:10.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So I did their laundry and served their</p>
<p begin="00:42:08.918" end="00:42:11.618" style="s2">tea and I had to pay them for the</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.218" end="00:42:13.318" style="s2">privilege?</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.618" end="00:42:14.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I kept a copy of the will and some</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.318" end="00:42:17.218" style="s2">payment records.</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.718" end="00:42:19.318" style="s2">Last year&#39;s rent was 40 gold coins</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.218" end="00:42:22.218" style="s2">collected by Catherine Blackwood.</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.318" end="00:42:24.018" style="s2">She signed for it herself.</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.218" end="00:42:25.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you give me those records?</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.018" end="00:42:27.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.018" end="00:42:28.718" style="s2">I&#39;ll send you copies.</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.318" end="00:42:30.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.718" end="00:42:31.018" style="s2">Please don&#39;t give them to my father or</p>
<p begin="00:42:30.018" end="00:42:33.918" style="s2">Catherine.</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.018" end="00:42:33.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand, Miss Leah.</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.118" end="00:42:41.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hear you&#39;ve been asking about your</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.318" end="00:42:43.718" style="s2">mother&#39;s estate.</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.518" end="00:42:45.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m taking stock of what&#39;s mine.</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.718" end="00:42:46.974" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the rush?</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.218" end="00:42:48.018" style="s2">Have I ever said you wouldn&#39;t get it?</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.974" end="00:42:49.918" style="s2">[music] There&#39;s just something you need</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.018" end="00:42:51.018" style="s2">to do first.</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.918" end="00:42:52.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.018" end="00:42:53.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The succession assembly is</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.120" end="00:42:55.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; coming up.</p>
<p begin="00:42:53.320" end="00:42:56.799" style="s2">As Ronan&#39;s wife, all you need to do is</p>
<p begin="00:42:55.220" end="00:42:58.819" style="s2">confirm that he&#39;s unfit to inherit.</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.799" end="00:42:58.819" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.420" end="00:43:03.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want me to destroy Ronan&#39;s claim?</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.020" end="00:43:07.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; tell a few simple [music] truths and you</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.820" end="00:43:08.420" style="s2">can have everything that&#39;s left of your</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.020" end="00:43:12.320" style="s2">mother&#39;s estate,</p>
<p begin="00:43:08.420" end="00:43:14.920" style="s2">the deeds, the gold, the ledgers.</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.320" end="00:43:17.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those things are already mine.</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.920" end="00:43:19.820" style="s2">I found [music] the estate manager.</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.220" end="00:43:21.720" style="s2">Copies of the evidence are safe.</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.820" end="00:43:25.320" style="s2">I won&#39;t testify [music] for you</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.720" end="00:43:27.620" style="s2">and I will take back what&#39;s mine.</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.320" end="00:43:27.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leah.</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.420" end="00:43:32.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard everything. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.220" end="00:43:38.420" style="s2">Give me the records.</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.020" end="00:43:39.420" style="s2">I can recover the land, the rent,</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.420" end="00:43:40.720" style="s2">everything [music] they&#39;ve kept from</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.420" end="00:43:43.120" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.720" end="00:43:43.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.320" end="00:43:46.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to face them alone</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.420" end="00:43:46.720" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:43:47.220" end="00:43:49.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll check the records with the estate</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.420" end="00:43:51.520" style="s2">manager and demand the deeds from my</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.920" end="00:43:54.520" style="s2">father.</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.520" end="00:43:54.520" style="s2">I know what to do next.</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.520" end="00:43:59.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re putting all this together so you</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.720" end="00:44:00.620" style="s2">can leave?</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.020" end="00:44:02.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.620" end="00:44:04.820" style="s2">Once I have mother&#39;s property back, I</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.020" end="00:44:04.820" style="s2">can live on my own.</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.820" end="00:44:10.320" style="s2">I don&#39;t need you arranging my life,</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.120" end="00:44:10.320" style="s2">Ronan. You&#39;re not that important.</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.320" end="00:44:20.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, Victor has brought the succession</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.120" end="00:44:20.920" style="s2">assembly forward.</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.520" end="00:44:26.020" style="s2">As Ronan Fenwick remains unable to</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.520" end="00:44:27.920" style="s2">fulfill his duties following his injury,</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.020" end="00:44:30.220" style="s2">the succession assembly will convene</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.920" end="00:44:32.820" style="s2">early to confirm Gareth Fenwick&#39;s right</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.220" end="00:44:32.820" style="s2">to inherit.</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.820" end="00:44:38.420" style="s2">He&#39;s also summoned the Blackwoods to</p>
<p begin="00:44:36.320" end="00:44:39.720" style="s2">testify that your mental impairment is</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.420" end="00:44:41.120" style="s2">permanent</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.720" end="00:44:43.720" style="s2">and you&#39;re incapable of managing</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.120" end="00:44:43.720" style="s2">affairs.</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.020" end="00:44:50.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.666" end="00:44:59.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.121" end="00:45:01.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The family has decided to support</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.421" end="00:45:02.021" style="s2">Victor. At the assembly, you&#39;ll do as I</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.321" end="00:45:03.421" style="s2">say.</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.021" end="00:45:03.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t Catherine tell you I already said</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.421" end="00:45:06.921" style="s2">no?</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.821" end="00:45:06.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s why I came myself.</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.221" end="00:45:10.921" style="s2">Confirm that [music] Ronan&#39;s still an</p>
<p begin="00:45:08.621" end="00:45:12.321" style="s2">idiot and Victor will grant our family a</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.921" end="00:45:14.221" style="s2">new territory.</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.321" end="00:45:16.421" style="s2">You&#39;ll be compensated [music] too.</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.221" end="00:45:19.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And after Ronan loses his claim?</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.421" end="00:45:19.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not your concern.</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.121" end="00:45:23.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m asking [music] about me.</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.121" end="00:45:27.121" style="s2">Will you leave me with Ronan or hand me</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.821" end="00:45:27.121" style="s2">to someone else you can use?</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.221" end="00:45:32.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s no need to put it like that.</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.121" end="00:45:34.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You weren&#39;t ashamed to do it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.221" end="00:45:36.521" style="s2">Why are you ashamed to hear me say it?</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.621" end="00:45:41.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you forgotten who I am? I&#39;M YOUR</p>
<p begin="00:45:36.521" end="00:45:41.021" style="s2">FATHER. HOW DARE YOU TALK BACK TO ME?</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.121" end="00:45:47.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THIS IS A COPY OF MY MOTHER&#39;S WILL.</p>
<p begin="00:45:45.521" end="00:45:48.721" style="s2">It clearly states that everything she</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.121" end="00:45:51.321" style="s2">owned goes to her daughter, Leah</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.721" end="00:45:51.321" style="s2">Blackwood.</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.121" end="00:45:55.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who gave you that?</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.321" end="00:46:02.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s none of your concern.</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.621" end="00:46:03.721" style="s2">I&#39;ll recover the deeds and the income</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.121" end="00:46:04.821" style="s2">and I won&#39;t give the testimony you want</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.721" end="00:46:05.921" style="s2">at the assembly.</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.821" end="00:46:07.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LEAH,</p>
<p begin="00:46:05.921" end="00:46:09.221" style="s2">I&#39;M YOUR FATHER.</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.521" end="00:46:11.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My father?</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.221" end="00:46:13.821" style="s2">When have you ever acted like one?</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.921" end="00:46:15.821" style="s2">When you need something,</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.821" end="00:46:17.021" style="s2">I&#39;m your daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.821" end="00:46:19.421" style="s2">The rest of the time I&#39;m just the</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.021" end="00:46:21.721" style="s2">Blackwoods&#39; is slave.</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.421" end="00:46:21.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.921" end="00:46:30.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re done talking. Now get out.</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.021" end="00:46:30.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll regret this.</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.321" end="00:46:40.821" style="s2">She refused.</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.821" end="00:46:44.121" style="s2">Money, land,</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.821" end="00:46:44.121" style="s2">she wouldn&#39;t listen to any of it.</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.721" end="00:46:49.721" style="s2">That two-faced Does she even know</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.721" end="00:46:49.721" style="s2">what she&#39;s turning down?</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.521" end="00:46:54.521" style="s2">What she says doesn&#39;t matter.</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.821" end="00:46:57.421" style="s2">What matters is that several lords still</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.521" end="00:46:58.422" style="s2">refuse to recognize my son.</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.421" end="00:47:00.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father,</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.422" end="00:47:03.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; just kill the ones who refuse. Then all</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.323" end="00:47:05.422" style="s2">that&#39;s left are the ones who agree.</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.023" end="00:47:05.422" style="s2">Idiot.</p>
<p begin="00:47:06.323" end="00:47:09.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That empty head of yours is why those</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.023" end="00:47:11.823" style="s2">lords still won&#39;t support you, even</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.922" end="00:47:14.422" style="s2">after Ronan&#39;s been out of action for so</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.823" end="00:47:14.422" style="s2">long.</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.523" end="00:47:17.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not my fault.</p>
<p begin="00:47:19.422" end="00:47:21.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father,</p>
<p begin="00:47:20.422" end="00:47:24.023" style="s2">didn&#39;t you say Ronan&#39;s especially</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.622" end="00:47:25.723" style="s2">attached to his wife, Leah?</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.023" end="00:47:28.023" style="s2">Perhaps we can use that.</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.723" end="00:47:28.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.023" end="00:47:37.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll need your help with this, Richard.</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.622" end="00:47:42.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The succession assembly will be held in</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.023" end="00:47:45.223" style="s2">the capital&#39;s castle.</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.023" end="00:47:45.223" style="s2">It&#39;ll be full of Victor&#39;s men.</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.823" end="00:47:50.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hell now scare his succession at the</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.422" end="00:47:51.723" style="s2">assembly.</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.323" end="00:47:54.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The board of lords have already agreed</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.723" end="00:47:56.223" style="s2">to support you.</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.422" end="00:47:58.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the North Gate?</p>
<p begin="00:47:56.223" end="00:48:00.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The commander hasn&#39;t agreed.</p>
<p begin="00:47:58.422" end="00:48:02.723" style="s2">He says opening the gate is easy, but</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.323" end="00:48:04.422" style="s2">Victor controls the city.</p>
<p begin="00:48:02.723" end="00:48:07.323" style="s2">He won&#39;t send his soldiers to die for an</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.422" end="00:48:07.323" style="s2">heir who can&#39;t win.</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.023" end="00:48:12.223" style="s2">I can try talking to him again.</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.323" end="00:48:13.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s right to ask.</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.223" end="00:48:17.122" style="s2">We can&#39;t have them open the gate only to</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.723" end="00:48:17.122" style="s2">find there&#39;s no army behind us.</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.122" end="00:48:24.723" style="s2">Secure the North Gate garrison first.</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.723" end="00:48:25.922" style="s2">Once support inside is confirmed, the</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.723" end="00:48:28.723" style="s2">border lords can bring their troops</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.922" end="00:48:28.723" style="s2">toward the capital.</p>
<p begin="00:48:29.122" end="00:48:33.823" style="s2">Until that support is in place, no</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.922" end="00:48:35.122" style="s2">troops move and no one declares for me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:33.823" end="00:48:37.422" style="s2">Tell them not to hand themselves over to</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.122" end="00:48:39.922" style="s2">Victor just to prove their loyalty.</p>
<p begin="00:48:37.422" end="00:48:39.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.122" end="00:48:44.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Contact the commander again. Whatever</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.723" end="00:48:46.523" style="s2">his concerns, he can ask me directly.</p>
<p begin="00:48:44.622" end="00:48:48.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A copy of the will,</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.523" end="00:48:50.122" style="s2">rent receipts.</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.523" end="00:48:53.223" style="s2">I&#39;m still missing the original deeds and</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.122" end="00:48:53.223" style="s2">the full income ledgers.</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.523" end="00:49:00.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can send someone with those records to</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.122" end="00:49:00.324" style="s2">verify everything with your father?</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.024" end="00:49:05.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll go myself. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:49:03.824" end="00:49:07.324" style="s2">It&#39;s my mother&#39;s property. I want to</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.024" end="00:49:10.624" style="s2">watch them handed over.</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.324" end="00:49:10.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you don&#39;t want me involved.</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.724" end="00:49:13.224" style="s2">I have two men I trust from my old</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.024" end="00:49:15.024" style="s2">command. They&#39;ll follow your</p>
<p begin="00:49:13.224" end="00:49:17.024" style="s2">instructions and keep you safe. Nothing</p>
<p begin="00:49:15.024" end="00:49:19.324" style="s2">more.</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.024" end="00:49:19.324" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.224" end="00:49:23.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The guards can come.</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.924" end="00:49:25.124" style="s2">I&#39;ll handle the verification and</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.024" end="00:49:27.524" style="s2">recovery myself.</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.124" end="00:49:27.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.824" end="00:49:31.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.524" end="00:49:43.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, the North Gate commander has</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.424" end="00:49:45.124" style="s2">replied.</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.524" end="00:49:47.224" style="s2">He&#39;ll meet you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.124" end="00:49:48.524" style="s2">But he has one condition.</p>
<p begin="00:49:47.224" end="00:49:50.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.524" end="00:49:52.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He wants to see that you can still take</p>
<p begin="00:49:50.124" end="00:49:52.924" style="s2">back the North.</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.924" end="00:50:04.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The North Gate commander [music] is</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.824" end="00:50:04.224" style="s2">inside. He&#39;s alone.</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.324" end="00:50:10.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So the room is [music] really can&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.424" end="00:50:10.924" style="s2">trusted.</p>
<p begin="00:50:13.824" end="00:50:15.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for agreeing [music] to meet</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.824" end="00:50:17.424" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.324" end="00:50:20.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t thank me yet. I haven&#39;t agreed to</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.424" end="00:50:20.324" style="s2">open the gate for you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.524" end="00:50:26.924" style="s2">Tell me why [music] my soldiers should</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.824" end="00:50:26.924" style="s2">risk their lives for you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.524" end="00:50:32.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First, take a look at what I&#39;ve brought.</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.724" end="00:50:41.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After all those years we fed you, you</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.424" end="00:50:44.624" style="s2">bring men here to threaten us?</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.424" end="00:50:47.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here for my mother&#39;s estate.</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.624" end="00:50:50.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out of my way. THIS IS MY HOUSE.</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.824" end="00:50:50.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please begin.</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.724" end="00:50:57.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One stone house west of town, five acres</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.324" end="00:51:00.424" style="s2">of apple orchards, and 100 gold coins,</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.024" end="00:51:00.424" style="s2">all left to Lyra Blackwood.</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.724" end="00:51:06.125" style="s2">The rental income verified so totals 240</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.825" end="00:51:06.725" style="s2">gold coins, all collected by Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.125" end="00:51:08.825" style="s2">Blackwood.</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.725" end="00:51:10.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Was raising her free?</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.825" end="00:51:12.325" style="s2">Clothes, food.</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.625" end="00:51:14.325" style="s2">Did any of that cost nothing? You&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:51:12.325" end="00:51:15.725" style="s2">said all that before.</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.325" end="00:51:18.525" style="s2">Now bring out the deeds so we can check</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.725" end="00:51:18.525" style="s2">the accounts.</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.925" end="00:51:34.825" style="s2">And my mother&#39;s belongings, her clothes,</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.125" end="00:51:36.825" style="s2">old letters, any jewelry you haven&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.825" end="00:51:38.225" style="s2">returned. I want to check every item.</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.825" end="00:51:39.625" style="s2">It&#39;s all scattered around the old house.</p>
<p begin="00:51:38.225" end="00:51:41.025" style="s2">I can&#39;t just produce it. I&#39;ll let you</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.625" end="00:51:44.525" style="s2">know when I&#39;ve sorted it out.</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.025" end="00:51:44.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. I&#39;ll wait.</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.925" end="00:51:50.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All three border lords have pledged</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.725" end="00:51:51.525" style="s2">troops.</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.125" end="00:51:53.625" style="s2">600 men.</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.525" end="00:51:56.425" style="s2">15 days of provisions. They&#39;ll share the</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.625" end="00:51:56.425" style="s2">cost of supplies.</p>
<p begin="00:51:57.025" end="00:51:59.925" style="s2">But my men are still right under</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.325" end="00:52:01.025" style="s2">Victor&#39;s nose.</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.925" end="00:52:02.325" style="s2">I&#39;ll lead the force into the city</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.025" end="00:52:03.725" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.325" end="00:52:05.125" style="s2">Hold the gate and the border troops can</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.725" end="00:52:08.425" style="s2">reinforce us.</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.125" end="00:52:08.425" style="s2">Our supplies can get through, too.</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.725" end="00:52:15.125" style="s2">On the night of the operation, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.125" end="00:52:18.525" style="s2">the north gate will be mine. I&#39;ll put my</p>
<p begin="00:52:15.125" end="00:52:18.525" style="s2">own men on duty and let you in.</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.125" end="00:52:32.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now Victor wants me to kidnap Leah.</p>
<p begin="00:52:30.725" end="00:52:35.425" style="s2">This is Ronan&#39;s territory. That&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.625" end="00:52:35.425" style="s2">death wish.</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.825" end="00:52:41.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her mother&#39;s belongings.</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.925" end="00:52:44.725" style="s2">Then why don&#39;t we make her leave Ronan&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.425" end="00:52:44.725" style="s2">territory of her own accord?</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.325" end="00:52:56.186" style="s2">How did this happen? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.225" end="00:53:00.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I ran into a patrol on the way back.</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.125" end="00:53:00.725" style="s2">It&#39;s nothing. Just</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.325" end="00:53:05.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit still.</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.125" end="00:53:06.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victor&#39;s men blocked [music] the road.</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.925" end="00:53:07.327" style="s2">I</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.027" end="00:53:09.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; caught myself on an iron hook going</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.327" end="00:53:09.727" style="s2">around them.</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.127" end="00:53:14.527" style="s2">I met with the North Gate [music]</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.927" end="00:53:14.527" style="s2">Commander.</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.327" end="00:53:18.527" style="s2">He agreed.</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.927" end="00:53:20.927" style="s2">On the night we move, he&#39;ll secure the</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.527" end="00:53:22.427" style="s2">gate and let [music] us in.</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.927" end="00:53:25.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.427" end="00:53:25.227" style="s2">I&#39;m not interested.</p>
<p begin="00:53:25.727" end="00:53:30.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When this is over,</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.527" end="00:53:30.327" style="s2">I&#39;ll let you go.</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.502" end="00:53:35.727" style="s2">[music] Whether you stay or leave,</p>
<p begin="00:53:33.627" end="00:53:37.227" style="s2">these will be yours to control.</p>
<p begin="00:53:35.727" end="00:53:40.327" style="s2">I won&#39;t force you,</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.227" end="00:53:40.327" style="s2">and I won&#39;t lie to you again.</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.527" end="00:53:44.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep the wound dry. Get some rest</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.427" end="00:53:44.827" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.127" end="00:53:49.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lia.</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.327" end="00:53:52.727" style="s2">If</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.527" end="00:53:53.927" style="s2">I mean, [music] if all of this works</p>
<p begin="00:53:52.727" end="00:53:55.127" style="s2">out,</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.927" end="00:53:57.427" style="s2">is there any chance we could start</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.127" end="00:53:57.427" style="s2">again?</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.727" end="00:54:01.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.227" end="00:54:04.227" style="s2">But whatever happens, I want you to</p>
<p begin="00:54:01.827" end="00:54:04.227" style="s2">live.</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.327" end="00:54:10.127" style="s2">Don&#39;t throw your life away for power,</p>
<p begin="00:54:07.727" end="00:54:10.127" style="s2">Ronan.</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.327" end="00:54:15.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Blackwood sent this. She says</p>
<p begin="00:54:13.527" end="00:54:16.027" style="s2">she&#39;ll return the remaining belongings</p>
<p begin="00:54:15.227" end="00:54:18.927" style="s2">and wants [music] you to check the</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.027" end="00:54:18.927" style="s2">inventory first.</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.827" end="00:54:25.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello?</p>
<p begin="00:54:23.527" end="00:54:27.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everything&#39;s at your mother&#39;s old house.</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.627" end="00:54:30.427" style="s2">Come and check it yourself so you can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:54:27.427" end="00:54:32.327" style="s2">accuse us of hiding anything later.</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.427" end="00:54:33.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now?</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.327" end="00:54:36.327" style="s2">Is Ronan back?</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.927" end="00:54:37.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet. He&#39;s outside the [music] city</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.327" end="00:54:40.427" style="s2">confirming the troop movements with the</p>
<p begin="00:54:37.727" end="00:54:40.427" style="s2">border lords.</p>
<p begin="00:54:41.127" end="00:54:44.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please tell him where [music] I&#39;ve gone.</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.827" end="00:54:46.027" style="s2">Both guards are coming with me. The</p>
<p begin="00:54:44.327" end="00:54:48.627" style="s2">carriage stays at the door.</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.027" end="00:54:48.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll arrange it.</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.027" end="00:54:51.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 4:00.</p>
<p begin="00:54:50.227" end="00:54:53.127" style="s2">If I&#39;m not back by [music] then, send</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.427" end="00:54:54.527" style="s2">someone to find me. Even if you&#39;re told</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.127" end="00:54:55.327" style="s2">I decided to stay longer, don&#39;t believe</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.527" end="00:54:57.927" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:54:55.327" end="00:54:57.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.727" end="00:55:03.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all here. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.227" end="00:55:03.827" style="s2">Take your time.</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.728" end="00:55:16.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother.</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.228" end="00:55:16.528" style="s2">I&#39;ve missed you so much.</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.628" end="00:55:21.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, lock the door.</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.328" end="00:55:25.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yours?</p>
<p begin="00:55:21.728" end="00:55:25.028" style="s2">Do you even know how much it&#39;s worth?</p>
<p begin="00:55:25.428" end="00:55:28.528" style="s2">Another distress signal.</p>
<p begin="00:55:35.128" end="00:55:37.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Open up.</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.328" end="00:55:46.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There you are, finally.</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.128" end="00:55:53.028" style="s2">Let go of me.</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.328" end="00:56:00.728" style="s2">Don&#39;t make this harder [music] for</p>
<p begin="00:55:57.228" end="00:56:00.728" style="s2">everyone. Get in.</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.128" end="00:56:07.628" style="s2">Grab her.</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.628" end="00:56:16.728" style="s2">Help. Let go.</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.928" end="00:56:16.728" style="s2">There&#39;s no way out.</p>
<p begin="00:56:19.028" end="00:56:22.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one&#39;s saving you [music] today.</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.128" end="00:56:33.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your wife is missing.</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.928" end="00:56:34.828" style="s2">She said she&#39;d be back by 4:00. My men</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.128" end="00:56:36.028" style="s2">found only [music] her two guards, both</p>
<p begin="00:56:34.828" end="00:56:37.928" style="s2">wounded.</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.028" end="00:56:41.228" style="s2">Soldiers surrounded the old house. She</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.928" end="00:56:41.228" style="s2">was taken away in a carriage.</p>
<p begin="00:56:43.528" end="00:56:48.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which way?</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.928" end="00:56:48.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re still finding out.</p>
<p begin="00:56:50.528" end="00:56:55.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From Mr. Victor Fenwick, he insists</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.948" end="00:56:55.728" style="s2">[music] Mr. Ronan Fenwick be informed.</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.028" end="00:57:01.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gareth Fenwick and Lieve Blackwood will</p>
<p begin="00:57:00.828" end="00:57:04.128" style="s2">be married on the eve of [music] the</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.928" end="00:57:06.528" style="s2">succession assembly.</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.128" end="00:57:08.529" style="s2">Our cousin, Ronan Fenwick, is cordially</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.528" end="00:57:11.129" style="s2">invited to attend and offer the happy</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.529" end="00:57:11.129" style="s2">his blessing.</p>
<p begin="00:57:17.729" end="00:57:22.129" style="s2">Sign it, and you won&#39;t have to stay here</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.449" end="00:57:22.129" style="s2">[music] any longer.</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.829" end="00:57:27.429" style="s2">I confirm that Ronan Fennick is</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.529" end="00:57:29.629" style="s2">incapable of fulfilling his duties as a</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.429" end="00:57:31.229" style="s2">husband and heir to the [music] north</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.629" end="00:57:33.729" style="s2">and willingly agree to dissolve our</p>
<p begin="00:57:31.229" end="00:57:37.029" style="s2">marriage.</p>
<p begin="00:57:33.729" end="00:57:37.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this why you kidnapped [music] me?</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.429" end="00:57:41.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sign, and no one will touch your</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.129" end="00:57:43.129" style="s2">mother&#39;s estate or your money again.</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.629" end="00:57:44.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re already mine.</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.129" end="00:57:47.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only if someone is willing to recognize</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.629" end="00:57:47.129" style="s2">your claim.</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.829" end="00:57:53.229" style="s2">Ronan can&#39;t protect [music] you. You&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:57:50.229" end="00:57:53.229" style="s2">seen that for yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.815" end="00:57:56.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:57:58.829" end="00:58:03.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s your answer.</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.529" end="00:58:06.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll regret that choice.</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.329" end="00:58:06.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send Gareth in.</p>
<p begin="00:58:09.629" end="00:58:12.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you know how many lords father&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.929" end="00:58:14.129" style="s2">invited?</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.629" end="00:58:16.329" style="s2">They&#39;ll all be there to watch you marry</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.129" end="00:58:16.329" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.729" end="00:58:19.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You need soldiers to hold your bride</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.029" end="00:58:21.529" style="s2">down before you&#39;re brave enough to marry</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.329" end="00:58:21.529" style="s2">her?</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.529" end="00:58:37.729" style="s2">Don&#39;t [music] touch me, you monster.</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.529" end="00:58:39.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ronan&#39;s territories will be mine. So</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.729" end="00:58:42.129" style="s2">will you.</p>
<p begin="00:58:39.529" end="00:58:44.669" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not one of his territories.</p>
<p begin="00:58:42.129" end="00:58:44.669" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not your decision. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.129" end="00:58:53.529" style="s2">You think we haven&#39;t noticed Ronan&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.490" end="00:58:53.529" style="s2">[music] been playing the fool?</p>
<p begin="00:58:54.029" end="00:58:59.229" style="s2"> lords would rather wait for a</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.729" end="00:59:01.029" style="s2">useless fraud than support me.</p>
<p begin="00:58:59.229" end="00:59:02.829" style="s2">I want them to see that Ronan has a</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.029" end="00:59:04.929" style="s2">weakness, too. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.829" end="00:59:06.529" style="s2">If he can&#39;t even keep his wife,</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.929" end="00:59:08.929" style="s2">who&#39;ll dare put soldiers under his</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.529" end="00:59:08.929" style="s2">command?</p>
<p begin="00:59:11.329" end="00:59:13.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come in.</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.331" end="00:59:20.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.331" end="00:59:23.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something to keep that mouth of yours</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.931" end="00:59:23.531" style="s2">quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.231" end="00:59:30.731" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.431" end="00:59:39.671" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enjoy yourself,</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.651" end="00:59:39.671" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cough]</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.831" end="00:59:43.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you all for coming.</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.031" end="00:59:47.031" style="s2">Since [music] his injury, Ronan has</p>
<p begin="00:59:45.331" end="00:59:49.331" style="s2">remained incapable of governing the</p>
<p begin="00:59:47.031" end="00:59:50.531" style="s2">north.</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.331" end="00:59:53.631" style="s2">His marriage to Leah [music] has now</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.531" end="00:59:53.631" style="s2">also been dissolved.</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.731" end="00:59:57.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ronan agreed to this?</p>
<p begin="00:59:58.731" end="01:00:01.886" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You all saw his condition at the last</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.331" end="01:00:04.231" style="s2">banquet. We can&#39;t expect him to make</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.886" end="01:00:05.531" style="s2">[music] a decision like this.</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.231" end="01:00:08.731" style="s2">As for Leah,</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.531" end="01:00:08.731" style="s2">her father can speak for [music] her.</p>
<p begin="01:00:09.331" end="01:00:15.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My daughter is to marry Gareth.</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.731" end="01:00:15.231" style="s2">Both families are in agreement.</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.631" end="01:00:25.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come here.</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.031" end="01:00:25.731" style="s2">Everyone&#39;s waiting.</p>
<p begin="01:00:30.706" end="01:00:32.726" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.831" end="01:00:39.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go.</p>
<p begin="01:00:36.231" end="01:00:39.231" style="s2">Stop making a scene.</p>
<p begin="01:00:42.131" end="01:00:45.231" style="s2">Just go and stand beside him.</p>
<p begin="01:00:47.736" end="01:00:49.756" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:00:54.931" end="01:00:58.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let her go.</p>
<p begin="01:00:56.931" end="01:01:00.831" style="s2">Nothing about this marriage looks</p>
<p begin="01:00:58.231" end="01:01:00.831" style="s2">consensual.</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.931" end="01:01:05.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s distressed.</p>
<p begin="01:01:04.331" end="01:01:06.431" style="s2">The ceremony is over. Take her somewhere</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.931" end="01:01:09.731" style="s2">to rest.</p>
<p begin="01:01:06.431" end="01:01:09.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You still haven&#39;t explained.</p>
<p begin="01:01:09.931" end="01:01:12.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow&#39;s succession assembly will</p>
<p begin="01:01:11.331" end="01:01:14.032" style="s2">proceed as planned.</p>
<p begin="01:01:12.931" end="01:01:16.932" style="s2">We can discuss the</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.032" end="01:01:16.932" style="s2">and inheritance then.</p>
<p begin="01:01:26.032" end="01:01:29.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Open the door.</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.132" end="01:01:33.932" style="s2">My voice is back.</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.832" end="01:01:36.207" style="s2">I&#39;ve been kidnapped. PLEASE SOMEONE HELP</p>
<p begin="01:01:33.932" end="01:01:38.227" style="s2">ME.</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.207" end="01:01:38.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.307" end="01:01:53.292" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:01:51.272" end="01:01:53.292" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:02:00.442" end="01:02:02.462" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:02:03.332" end="01:02:09.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WAITING for your husband, my sweet Leah?</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.832" end="01:02:10.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay back.</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.032" end="01:02:13.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your hands are shaking.</p>
<p begin="01:02:10.632" end="01:02:13.432" style="s2">Think you can hit me?</p>
<p begin="01:02:14.232" end="01:02:16.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Try me.</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.783" end="01:02:20.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.832" end="01:02:23.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at you.</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.632" end="01:02:23.632" style="s2">So beautiful.</p>
<p begin="01:02:27.932" end="01:02:32.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help. Move. Let me out.</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.832" end="01:02:39.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You dare hit me?</p>
<p begin="01:02:39.743" end="01:02:42.418" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:02:40.398" end="01:02:42.418" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:02:44.983" end="01:02:47.932" style="s2">[gasps] Baby,</p>
<p begin="01:02:46.732" end="01:02:50.432" style="s2">where do you think you&#39;re going to run</p>
<p begin="01:02:47.932" end="01:02:50.432" style="s2">tonight?</p>
<p begin="01:02:53.932" end="01:02:58.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The relief guards are detained. The gate</p>
<p begin="01:02:55.832" end="01:02:58.332" style="s2">is ours.</p>
<p begin="01:03:00.832" end="01:03:03.832" style="s2">Cut off the castle&#39;s communications with</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.232" end="01:03:06.532" style="s2">the garrison outside the city. Stop</p>
<p begin="01:03:03.832" end="01:03:06.532" style="s2">every messenger.</p>
<p begin="01:03:09.832" end="01:03:13.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They won&#39;t open the gates for us.</p>
<p begin="01:03:16.032" end="01:03:19.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then Then wait for them too.</p>
<p begin="01:03:28.333" end="01:03:30.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay away.</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.073" end="01:03:38.093" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:03:41.314" end="01:03:45.633" style="s2">[gasps and sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.533" end="01:03:45.633" style="s2">Ronan, where are you?</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.139" end="01:03:53.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:03:54.233" end="01:03:57.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU LITTLE BASTARD.</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.733" end="01:04:03.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; RESTRAIN HIM.</p>
<p begin="01:04:04.239" end="01:04:06.259" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.033" end="01:04:12.733" style="s2">ARE YOU HURT ANYWHERE?</p>
<p begin="01:04:17.339" end="01:04:19.359" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:04:21.733" end="01:04:25.133" style="s2">YOU WERE FAKING IT all along.</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.933" end="01:04:28.833" style="s2">Take his trousers off.</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.933" end="01:04:34.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT ARE YOU DOING?</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.333" end="01:04:36.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GARETH,</p>
<p begin="01:04:34.133" end="01:04:38.433" style="s2">remember this even in hell.</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.733" end="01:04:40.833" style="s2">This is the price of laying a hand on my</p>
<p begin="01:04:38.433" end="01:04:40.833" style="s2">wife.</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.884" end="01:04:46.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.633" end="01:04:49.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t DO THIS TO ME. MY FATHER WILL</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.033" end="01:04:49.133" style="s2">MAKE YOU PAY.</p>
<p begin="01:04:54.674" end="01:04:56.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:04:54.833" end="01:04:58.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU&#39;RE SAFE NOW, LEAH.</p>
<p begin="01:04:56.333" end="01:04:58.733" style="s2">Come with me.</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.533" end="01:05:13.733" style="s2">I thought you&#39;d keep hiding.</p>
<p begin="01:05:14.933" end="01:05:19.133" style="s2">You brought my wife here. Of course I</p>
<p begin="01:05:16.733" end="01:05:19.133" style="s2">came.</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.633" end="01:05:23.735" style="s2">He was in his right mind all along.</p>
<p begin="01:05:22.840" end="01:05:25.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.735" end="01:05:26.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Arrest him.</p>
<p begin="01:05:25.135" end="01:05:29.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He attacked the castle and disrupt the</p>
<p begin="01:05:26.835" end="01:05:29.135" style="s2">wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.035" end="01:05:35.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The North Gate sealed. The city guards</p>
<p begin="01:05:32.635" end="01:05:35.335" style="s2">won&#39;t let us through.</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.635" end="01:05:39.335" style="s2">They&#39;ve taken the armory.</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.135" end="01:05:41.235" style="s2">We can&#39;t get weapons.</p>
<p begin="01:05:39.335" end="01:05:42.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHERE ARE THE MEN AT THE MAIN GATE?</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.235" end="01:05:44.335" style="s2">BRING THEM HERE.</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.835" end="01:05:47.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE MEN you left waiting for me at the</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.335" end="01:05:47.835" style="s2">main gate won&#39;t be coming tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.235" end="01:05:56.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU DARED OPEN THE GATE FOR HIM?</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.235" end="01:06:01.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE BORDER FORCES HAVE cut off your</p>
<p begin="01:05:58.835" end="01:06:04.535" style="s2">reinforcements outside the city.</p>
<p begin="01:06:01.635" end="01:06:04.535" style="s2">It&#39;s over, Victor.</p>
<p begin="01:06:11.135" end="01:06:15.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We recognize Ronan Fenris&#39;s right to</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.035" end="01:06:18.335" style="s2">inherit and accept his command over the</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.135" end="01:06:18.335" style="s2">capital and its garrison.</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.635" end="01:06:23.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From this moment on, I take command of</p>
<p begin="01:06:21.835" end="01:06:26.135" style="s2">the Northern Pack.</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.235" end="01:06:26.135" style="s2">Does anyone object?</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.935" end="01:06:32.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are our alpha.</p>
<p begin="01:06:32.535" end="01:06:38.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When did you start planning all of this?</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.135" end="01:06:38.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The moment you took it from me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:41.441" end="01:06:43.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.371" end="01:06:47.391" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:06:50.611" end="01:06:52.631" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.035" end="01:07:01.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lock them up.</p>
<p begin="01:07:14.935" end="01:07:18.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to go back to the manor.</p>
<p begin="01:07:19.135" end="01:07:21.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="01:07:27.536" end="01:07:32.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When I first accepted this marriage,</p>
<p begin="01:07:29.256" end="01:07:32.836" style="s2">[music] it was for political advantage.</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.636" end="01:07:37.736" style="s2">Later,</p>
<p begin="01:07:36.136" end="01:07:40.446" style="s2">I kept pretending because I wanted to</p>
<p begin="01:07:37.736" end="01:07:40.446" style="s2">stay by your side. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:07:42.236" end="01:07:46.736" style="s2">I was afraid that if [music] you saw the</p>
<p begin="01:07:43.336" end="01:07:46.736" style="s2">real me, you wouldn&#39;t want me anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:07:49.136" end="01:07:52.936" style="s2">You did nothing wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:07:50.636" end="01:07:54.236" style="s2">I lied to you. I&#39;m sorry. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.936" end="01:07:55.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought getting married and leaving</p>
<p begin="01:07:54.236" end="01:07:58.236" style="s2">home meant I could finally choose my own</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.836" end="01:07:58.236" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="01:07:59.136" end="01:08:02.936" style="s2">Then I realized I never had a choice at</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.636" end="01:08:02.936" style="s2">all.</p>
<p begin="01:08:04.436" end="01:08:07.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all right.</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.436" end="01:08:10.836" style="s2">Whether you want to stay or leave, I</p>
<p begin="01:08:07.936" end="01:08:10.836" style="s2">won&#39;t force you again.</p>
<p begin="01:08:14.536" end="01:08:19.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mother&#39;s estate?</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.336" end="01:08:20.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve recovered it all.</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.436" end="01:08:22.136" style="s2">I had everything brought back from the</p>
<p begin="01:08:20.636" end="01:08:24.336" style="s2">old house. You can take it wherever you</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.136" end="01:08:24.336" style="s2">want.</p>
<p begin="01:08:28.536" end="01:08:32.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Ronin.</p>
<p begin="01:08:29.836" end="01:08:33.836" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.236" end="01:08:35.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victor and Gareth are found guilty of</p>
<p begin="01:08:33.836" end="01:08:36.936" style="s2">conspiring to seize control of the</p>
<p begin="01:08:35.412" end="01:08:38.736" style="s2">[music] north, kidnapping Leah, and</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.936" end="01:08:41.136" style="s2">forcing her into marriage. They are</p>
<p begin="01:08:38.736" end="01:08:42.536" style="s2">sentenced to death. Richard is guilty of</p>
<p begin="01:08:41.136" end="01:08:44.136" style="s2">aiding the kidnapping and giving false</p>
<p begin="01:08:42.536" end="01:08:45.536" style="s2">testimony. [music] Catherine is guilty</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.136" end="01:08:47.536" style="s2">of misappropriating the estate and</p>
<p begin="01:08:45.536" end="01:08:48.636" style="s2">luring Leah into a trap. Vanessa is</p>
<p begin="01:08:47.536" end="01:08:50.736" style="s2">guilty of participating in [music] the</p>
<p begin="01:08:48.636" end="01:08:54.236" style="s2">kidnapping. All three will serve prison</p>
<p begin="01:08:50.736" end="01:08:54.236" style="s2">sentences according to their crimes.</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.536" end="01:08:58.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leah,</p>
<p begin="01:08:56.536" end="01:09:01.667" style="s2">you&#39;re still a [music] Blackwood. You</p>
<p begin="01:08:58.036" end="01:09:01.667" style="s2">have TO HELP US. LEAH! [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:09:05.736" end="01:09:10.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE NORTHERN GARRISON swears allegiance</p>
<p begin="01:09:07.736" end="01:09:10.836" style="s2">to Ronin Fenwick.</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.136" end="01:09:17.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leah, [music]</p>
<p begin="01:09:14.736" end="01:09:17.736" style="s2">will you stand beside me?</p>
<p begin="01:09:30.538" end="01:09:33.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The first time we [music] married, no</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.538" end="01:09:37.038" style="s2">one asked you.</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.637" end="01:09:37.038" style="s2">Today I want to ask you myself.</p>
<p begin="01:09:38.293" end="01:09:42.338" style="s2">[music] Will you be my mate,</p>
<p begin="01:09:40.237" end="01:09:45.938" style="s2">the Luna of the North,</p>
<p begin="01:09:42.338" end="01:09:45.938" style="s2">and share responsibility for our future?</p>
<p begin="01:09:46.737" end="01:09:51.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will, Ronan.</p>
<p begin="01:09:48.538" end="01:09:51.737" style="s2">This time [music] it&#39;s my choice.</p>
<p begin="01:09:59.253" end="01:10:01.273" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:10:03.238" end="01:10:07.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To the North&#39;s new Alpha [music] and</p>
<p begin="01:10:05.038" end="01:10:07.438" style="s2">Luna.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
